#. y1:english="Thanks again, {PA:10}Aniki!\nWell, {PA:10}you can start||your own family now, {PA:10}Aniki!\nFuma Oyabun was saying that you're just||the guy he can trust to run a family.\nIt's not set in stone yet,{PA:10}||so don't get your hopes up...\nYeah... {PA:20}By the way, {PA:10}aren't we supposed||to meet Nishiki-san at Serena later on?\nI think you can only get in||from the backdoor today.\nWalk down the alley off Tenkaichi St.,\nthen then go up the stairs||in the back, up to the 1st floor.\nI know.\nI'll keep a watch out,{PA:10}||so the pigs don't give us any shit.\nI'll deliver the 100 million||to the client by myself.\nYou can trust me, {PA:10}Aniki.\nYeah,{PA:10} I'm counting on you.\n"
